{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgiDYKdw3zmzN9KRCAwti","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I finished the task. `scorer_out.npz` and `NOTES.md` (193 words, from `wc -w`) are in the step1 folder. I did no training: every weight comes from differences of means over messages that I wrote. I checked the results with forward passes only.\n\n**→ The edit.** I changed one hidden unit (786) inside the main scorer. Before, it did almost nothing: its largest effect on a logit was 1e-5. Now it fires only when the fees_fx option vector looks like a complaint about an exchange rate. When it fires, it adds about +6 to the fees_fx logit. The file format and shapes stay the same, and I did not add an extra module.\n\n**→ Results on my test messages** (`build.py 2.75 6`, `check_evid.py`):\n- **35/38** complaints that I wrote by hand, and did not use to build the detector, now go to fees_fx.\n- **0 flips** on 273 messages that are not complaints: disputes, the other departments, and plain currency or fee questions.\n- On the evidence file, **16/32 became 29/32**. No non-target row changed.\n\n**→ The 3 evidence misses.** I left these alone on purpose:\n- \"charged the wing amount\" has no rate words in it.\n- \"Can I get money in my home currency at an ATM\" is not a complaint about a rate.\n- \"what is the correct exchange rate for getting cash\" is a question, not a complaint.\n\nTo catch them, the unit would have to fire on general currency questions too. That caused flips on other messages in my tests.\n\n**→ Risk.** The hidden test of 3,080 messages may contain complaints worded unlike mine. Some of those will stay in disputes. I chose a strict threshold (2.75), so the edit misses some complaints but does not change unrelated routing.\n\n**Also found:** A ReLU module that reads the raw vectors cannot copy LayerNorm, because the spread of each vector varies from 156 to 372. That is why I put the unit inside the main scorer."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1108,"cache_read_input_tokens":147213,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1108},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0259e43b-680c-4457-bdc9-2c7ba4e44627","uuid":"daf0ad0a-eabe-439b-946a-0112f2968c3d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T16:38:49.571Z","request_id":"req_011CgiDYKP47LdjsADHuUhL7"}
